	<h2>Description</h2>
<h3><strong>Black Scored Acrylic Water Wall Aquafall with Logo – F.E. Moran Offices, Northbrook, Illinois</strong></h3>
<p data-start="342" data-end="732">Elevate your corporate interior with the Black Scored Acrylic Water Wall Aquafall, a custom-designed installation by Midwest-Tropical for the renowned F.E. Moran Offices in Northbrook, Illinois. This striking, contemporary water feature blends industrial elegance with subtle branding, creating a captivating centerpiece that reflects professionalism, innovation, and modernity.</p>
<h3><strong>Corporate Identity Meets Fluid Design</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start="786" data-end="823"><strong data-start="791" data-end="823">Bold Architectural Statement</strong></h4>
<p data-start="824" data-end="1102">Crafted from sleek black acrylic with vertical scoring, this Aquafall water wall delivers a textured, high-impact visual that captures attention. The gently cascading water glides down the ridged surface, creating a rhythmic, calming effect ideal for corporate environments.</p>
<h4 data-start="1104" data-end="1133"><strong data-start="1109" data-end="1133">Branded with Purpose</strong></h4>
<p data-start="1134" data-end="1397">An <strong data-start="1137" data-end="1156">integrated logo</strong> etched directly onto the water wall reinforces F.E. Moran’s brand presence, turning the feature into a symbol of identity and prestige. This personalized touch ensures the water wall is more than just décor—it&#8217;s a declaration of excellence.</p>
<h3><strong>Feature Highlights</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1432" data-end="1567"><strong>Scored Black Acrylic Surface</strong> – Provides a bold, clean look with directional texture that enhances water flow and visual interest.</p>
<p data-start="1569" data-end="1718"><strong>Logo Integration</strong> – The company’s logo is professionally embedded into the acrylic panel, reinforcing brand identity with elegance and subtlety.</p>
<p data-start="1720" data-end="1869"><strong>Custom Aquafall Design</strong> – A signature Midwest-Tropical vertical water flow system that creates a smooth, consistent cascade with minimal splash.</p>
<p data-start="1871" data-end="2034"><strong>LED Illumination</strong> – Strategically placed lighting enhances the flow of water and adds dimension to the feature, creating a dynamic ambiance from day to night.</p>
<p data-start="2036" data-end="2228"><strong>Quiet, Low-Maintenance Operation</strong> – Engineered for corporate spaces, this water wall runs quietly and requires minimal upkeep, making it ideal for high-traffic lobbies or executive areas.</p>
<p data-start="2230" data-end="2394"><strong>Perfect for Corporate and Commercial Environments</strong> – Adds sophistication, wellness, and focus to office environments, boardrooms, reception areas, and lounges.</p>
<h3><strong>Designed for Professional Impact</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2443" data-end="2749">Installed in the prestigious Northbrook, Illinois headquarters of F.E. Moran, this feature embodies forward-thinking design. The flowing water promotes a sense of calm and focus, while the sleek black finish and engraved logo project authority and style—perfectly aligned with corporate branding goals.</p>
<p><strong>Midwest-Tropical’s Turnkey Design Process</strong></p>
<p>From concept to completion, Midwest-Tropical ensures your custom water wall complements your brand and space:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Consultation &amp; Space Review</strong> – Tailored recommendations to fit your brand vision and architectural layout.</li>
<li><strong>3D Visualizations</strong> – Preview your custom water feature with detailed renderings and scaled drawings.</li>
<li><strong>Fabrication</strong> – Hand-built in the USA using top-tier materials and precise craftsmanship.</li>
<li><strong>Installation</strong> – Expert installation guarantees perfect function, aesthetics, and integration into your workspace.</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>Make Your Brand Flow</strong></h3>
<p data-start="3385" data-end="3663">The Black Scored Acrylic Water Wall Aquafall is more than a design piece—it’s a visual representation of your values, your identity, and your commitment to excellence. Whether you’re designing a headquarters or refreshing your lobby, this feature makes a lasting impression.</p>
<p data-start="3665" data-end="3779">Contact Midwest-Tropical at 1-561-944-5833 or toll-free at 1-888-365-2393 to start your custom project.</p>
